#lego-legacy-route 1
# LEGOLAND: cold boot (`--guest-args -nointro` until #395 adds IMA ADPCM
# 0x0011 for `Intro.avi`) through `Player Details` -> create profile "ADA" ->
# `Accept` -> rendered `Title Screen` -> `Exit Game` -> `Yes` -> clean exit 0
# (#394).
#
# Sequence:
# - Flips 0..9: `Player Details` renders with `Lego.TTF` GDI text, animated
#   `AD_Blink.avi` advisor orb, and `rab over icon.lls` cursor at (320, 240).
# - Flips 10..16: move to profile slot 1 (260, 187) and click to activate entry.
# - Flips 22..36: type "ADA" and confirm with Return (`profiles\Profile1.txt`).
# - Flips 50..56: move to `Accept` (562, 402) and click to enter `Title Screen`.
# - Flips 57..79: animated 640x480x16 `Title Screen` with `Start Game` unlocked.
# - Flips 80..86: click `Exit Game` (557, 93) to open `EXIT / Are you sure?`.
# - Flips 96..102: click green checkmark (395, 173) -> clean `ExitProcess(0)`.
flip 10 move 260 187
flip 14 down left
flip 16 up left
flip 22 key LeftShift down
flip 23 key A down
flip 24 key A up
flip 25 key D down
flip 26 key D up
flip 27 key A down
flip 28 key A up
flip 29 key LeftShift up
flip 34 key Return down
flip 36 key Return up
flip 50 move 562 402
flip 54 down left
flip 56 up left
flip 80 move 557 93
flip 84 down left
flip 86 up left
flip 96 move 395 173
flip 100 down left
flip 102 up left
